; lin standard library: wavefront gpu accelerator driver
;
; The Vulkan GPU driver was removed from the core to keep the engine small,
; portable, and crash-free (it triggered UB at -O2).  Hardware accelerators are
; now loadable plugins: a GPU/SIMD reducer can be compiled to a shared object
; and registered at runtime via (set_driver "/path/to/plugin.so").
;
; For portability this file keeps the CPU engine active.
(load "driver.lin")
(set_driver "cpu")